canon = "Ch7 (Keeper 2026-11-01, [C]): same dining room as ch6; the men have eaten, gold goblets; Tamlin seats her at the far end, meat and sauce and bread, pale sparkling wine. She won't eat (first rule, hands under her thighs). She shoots up; invisible hands shove her back once (the tang of magic, nothing visible); Tamlin: Do not do whatever it was you were contemplating; legs and middle stay bound until she eats. She sniffs, faeries can't lie, chicken first, eats the plate in silence; reaching for seconds of torte the food vanishes and the bonds loosen. Thank you for the meal; Lucien: Won't you stay for wine?; Tamlin: Go rest... ask the staff; she backs out; Lucien's laugh cut off by a growl. Invented (X): Sit. for ch7; the middle of go_rest."
